rantia de 273 Dias. • Valor do Kit.', 283.44, 266.43, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Internal Accessories for Automobiles > Car Audio System', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7reov-m1x74qwi3lb219', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F463375702%2F23293494497', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
